msgid "Your SD card is read-only"
msgstr "SD 卡为只读"

#: internal/settings/storage_ui.c
msgid ""
"Your SD card is read-only after a file system error. You can't save new "
"files or changes to this card. This can happen after an unexpected shutdown."
msgstr ""
"SD 卡在出现文件系统错误后变为只读。无法在此卡上保存新文件或更改。意外关机后可"
"能出现这种情况。"

