msgid "Your SD card is read-only. Nothing new can be saved to it."
msgstr "SD 卡为只读，无法保存任何新内容。"

#: internal/settings/storage_ui.c
msgid ""
"Your SD card is read-only. The cause couldn't be determined. You can't save "
"new files or changes to this card."
msgstr "SD 卡为只读，原因无法确定。无法在此卡上保存新文件或更改。"

#: internal/settings/storage_ui.c
msgid ""
"Your SD card is still protected. Turn off your device, repair the card on a "
"computer, safely eject it, then insert it and turn your device on to check "
"it again."
msgstr "你的 SD 卡仍处于保护状态。请关闭设备，在电脑上修复 SD 卡，安全弹出后重新插入，再开机检查。"

