#: internal/settings/storage_ui.c
msgid "Leaf checked this card and found file system errors, usually left by a shutdown that didn't finish saving. To keep your files safe, you can't save to this card until it's repaired."
msgstr ""
"Leaf 检查此卡后发现文件系统错误，通常是因\n"
"为关机时数据尚未保存完毕。为保护文件安全，\n"
"修复前此卡将无法写入。"

#: internal/settings/storage_ui.c
msgid "Leaf couldn't repair this card on your device. Turn off your device, repair the card on a computer, then check it here to save to it again."
msgstr ""
"Leaf 无法在设备上修复此卡。请关闭设备，在\n"
"电脑上修复存储卡，然后返回此处检查，检查通\n"
"过后才能再次写入。"

#: internal/settings/settings.c
msgid "Panel only"
msgstr "仅限设备屏幕"

#: internal/settings/storage_ui.c
msgid "The last check took too long and stopped. Restart your device to check the card again before saving is enabled."
msgstr ""
"上次检查耗时过长，已停止。请重启设备并重新\n"
"检查此卡，检查通过后才能再次保存文件。"

